{"id":"vod_bf_29340","vodId":"29340","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"上课小动作","name_cn":"上课小动作","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-30/2fe1095b45b69cf9e2ec10945737b48f.jpg"},"summary":"坐在班级最后一排的横井（花泽香菜 配音），她的邻座关同学（下野纮 配音）是个怪咖，他总是在上课时开小差——以令人叹为观止的方式玩着各种神乎其技的小游戏，从多诺米骨牌、将棋、围棋到桌上高尔夫，甚至是动手打磨改造桌子。关同学的这些上课小动作已经完全超出了“小动作”的范畴，以至于个性认真的横井无法对他的行为视而不见，尽管她想认真听课，可是每次都会不由自主地被关同学玩的小游戏吸引着。她常常用眼神或者低声开口阻止关同学，因此不时被老师点名批评。然而关同学我行我素，还练就了在老师发觉前就能销毁证据的拿手好戏。　　本动画以每集8分钟的长度，展现了关同学花样百出的“小动作“，加上横井的吐槽，这对邻座带给观众轻松爆笑的课上小故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 12:45:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shangkexiaodongzuo/第13集/index.